---
description: On Windows, invoke npm and npx via .cmd shims in terminal commands
alwaysApply: true
---

When running shell commands on Windows in this project, use `npm.cmd` instead of `npm` and `npx.cmd` instead of `npx` (e.g. `npm.cmd run build`, `npx.cmd prisma generate`). This avoids PowerShell execution policy / shim issues.
